From: Pedro <108982065+ultrapepo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 01 Oct 2026 09:40:43 GMT
Subject: [PATCH] fix(intext): harden late slot targeting maturity

Use two observations for own slot targeting and five for uncertain absence.
Compare native slot sets by logical ID and preserve per-key readiness.

Apply on top of the existing per-blocking-key working state.

